"RC input is configured by default via the USART2 RX input. It supports all "
"serial RC protocols except PPM."
msgstr "遥控输入默认通过USART2 RX引脚配置，支持除PPM外的所有串行遥控协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-resoluteh7.rst:56 42b89c6ef65c484bbe1e60c2b7fe84d3
