#: 84a8211ec17a44c8aa582e5e00ec5100 fd58751c074e4ae4b25083ec65f282ae
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX2 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2需要连接到TX2并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-resoluteh7.rst:60 6b23f6a2c0be4a518b4a8d593103e816
