#: c2c6f917b2dc476c88c27f56414a4f0c fb24ed0f081044f7ab6b45f122eadec4
msgid ""
"If the user wishes to use the SBUS from a DJI air unit for RC control, it is"
" suggested that the RX8 pads be used as shown in the wiring diagram and "
":ref:`SERIAL8_PROTOCOL <SERIAL8_PROTOCOL>` be set to \"23\" and "
":ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` be changed from \"23\" to "
"something else."
msgstr ""
"如果用户希望使用 DJI 天空端的 SBUS 进行 RC 控制，建议按接线图所示使用 RX8 焊盘，并将 :ref:`SERIAL8_PROTOCOL "
"<SERIAL8_PROTOCOL>` 设为 \"23\"，同时将 :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` "
"从 \"23\" 改为其他值。"

