#: 9d4084b0822a42e792ad16b6777ed3e0 9d45e157c1a64b64982dc59e9a8c8c50
#: a78f13bfef8b45e5a61a8e2836ba4830 e1c3f94727c046fd9bc07d9e11dc769f
msgid ""
"The Resolute H7 supports up to 11 outputs. Motor outputs M1 to M4 are on the"
" ESC connector, as well as pads. M5 to M7 are available on pads, along with "
"independent pads marked LED for LED strips and a PWM output near the camera "
"pads for camera OSD control. M1-8 support bi-directional DShot, and all the "
"outputs support DShot."
msgstr ""
"Resolute H7 最多支持 11 路输出。电机输出 M1 至 M4 位于电调连接器上，同时也提供焊盘。M5 至 M7 在焊盘上提供，另有标记为 "
"LED 的独立焊盘用于 LED 灯带，以及摄像头焊盘附近的一路 PWM 输出用于摄像头 OSD 控制。M1-8 支持双向 DShot，所有输出均支持 "
"DShot。"

