#: ../../source/docs/common-resoluteh7.rst:98 3d3f84add3f44554b6eb8d6afb3010d1
#: a58bd5b0b53149ebbd9d5fc6c3390ab6 bf638c1ea1f7449886a77bafa6c3c7fe
#: c1bd2d7141a946eb9fb8bdb5882e0b1c ce5e3ccb26494666ac2a15cd74c0e2e1
msgid "Camera control"
msgstr "相机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-resoluteh7.rst:100
#: 309a1601d21e4ef2a404ac3fcbb581bb 5205d90645ec437aa062f4974eef6c80
#: 80580580f75e4f408411185a3140fbd8 aebc1d8e061a43ceab92a6564a82dabe
#: d4baf680ec0f4f708770456f35af2e6b
msgid ""
"GPIO 82 controls the camera output to the connectors marked \"CAM1\" and "
"\"CAM2\". Setting this GPIO low switches the video output from CAM1 to CAM2."
" By default RELAY3 is configured to control this pin."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 82 控制输出到标记为 \"CAM1\" 和 \"CAM2\" 的连接器的摄像头信号。将此 GPIO 置低会把视频输出从 CAM1 切换到 "
"CAM2。默认情况下 RELAY3 被配置为控制此引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-resoluteh7.rst:103
#: 39cb587ef99849bcb1f06f2789f8b5a1 8866fca50b244f1d983733ba1f58ecf4
#: 98a4baacd7d44c05a93e416ed4e0c596 9a9c9b60bd9e4cddb324246abcb70f75
#: c604b3c3140c44c8ab7b45824f8e972d
msgid "VTX Power Control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-resoluteh7.rst:105
#: 000e977c7ba74bc58959f67ed16fc210 7075ba431f1943c694dbcd4b37684499
#: 733d3da305a04ea2b51b81707c29eae2 b8b6d021d61649f798b88acf78d7826f
#: c3bc5ce0bd114a66a20d553ff965d90a
msgid ""
"GPIO 81 provides on/off control of the 12V supply. RELAY 2 controls this "
"GPIO"
msgstr "GPIO 81 提供 12V 电源的通/断控制。RELAY 2 控制此 GPIO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-resoluteh7.rst:108
#: 37cdfdf842db48d1bc6453b1fb566522 578935c8184e46d686efc3d87ae21906
#: 6e1add346c5447ea9cc6a1174d10b142 8dc0ff69fe514020984d41863c7b2eba
#: e374851dc2ea454c8429b83a341d9eb9
msgid "HD VTX connector"
msgstr "高清图传连接器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-resoluteh7.rst:110
#: 2f57ec13896142bea0b0a58c9fb21db5 3a431b3e66294fda81cec2fc33847a52
#: 8432aea405c346a3a924328267568fc6 b086b4475b0b4fb1b5d2eedfa8faace4
#: d277dd863da04dcaaaed194664cc9fbc
msgid ""
"When using HD video transmission, the flight controller needs to connect to "
"DJI TX and RX via Serial 1."
msgstr "使用高清图传时，飞控需要通过 Serial 1 连接 DJI 的 TX 和 RX。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-resoluteh7.rst:113
#: 39acb1f6a5984d5c90a0655ed8666dc8 8ef669def9824b6da029781da4337215
#: 93d77f13cede419b8b6e09fcbc9011d2 da2596e093384fd9b65de76e7eaa56fa
#: ff9f795ba7c04eefae7da3b5e34882fd
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-resoluteh7.rst:115
#: 02c5a5c0be614fcb9fcd8b97549e9378 27dc23b8ef2145f2a416161b2ae398e0
#: 86df82c84015430db451bd3d9d8b30b2 b5af43d2a2ed4d2b83410a25184ed39d
#: bb13b5be404d4caaa0e7815404ceb15f
msgid ""
"The Resolute H7 has an onboard OSD using a MAX7456 chip and is enabled by "
"default. The CAM1/2 and VTX pins provide connections for using the internal "
"OSD. Simultaneous DisplayPort OSD is also possible and is configured by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Resolute H7 板载 OSD 使用 MAX7456 芯片，默认启用。CAM1/2 和 VTX 引脚提供使用内部 OSD 的连接。也可同时使用 "
"DisplayPort OSD，且默认已配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-resoluteh7.rst:118
#: 00abf78027154110b0183c6e1a9b9386 24a49466984a46a694c193da5f6c3772
#: 2df05d096fa9494cbf71950950db0a78 7f0842e34faf49869e33f69654565dcc
#: e7801f34c621407498a0e8b234fedf44
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-resoluteh7.rst:120
#: 129c6c9ef9464d3dbd22036ab61376e2 6226c181b35847f289f6c20ec7bcad8e
#: 64dbcf7a987a4e908fe677a2be4c9dde 6d824c9248b949379cb1537942d752ca
#: dc553aa263104ed2b0d93d0be9b91a11
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ in sub-folders labeled \"ResoluteH7\". "
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favorite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"这些板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 标为 \"ResoluteH7\" "
"的子文件夹中找到。首次加载固件可通过 DFU 完成：按住 bootloader 按钮插入 USB，然后使用你喜欢的 DFU 加载工具加载 "
"\"with_bl.hex\" 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-resoluteh7.rst:125
#: 70562c99e82f4308b509042a608bd143 c5ab6e4232ca42a39481b3f65e07680c
#: d68998042d24423ab16f3bec39593618 e44bd40c4dbe4667957730769d046c8b
#: f25c7a93acd44351bd0ce7d49ef888d5
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj "
"firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可以使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
